<section id="A6.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">F.2 </span>Prompt for Qualitative Attention Analysis</h3>

<div id="A6.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#S6.F5" title="Figure 5 ‣ 6.5 Qualitative Analysis ‣ 6 Experiments ‣ Implicit Reasoning for Large Language Model-based Generative Recommendation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> visualizes the pause-token attention pattern for the following example. The target item is a Dove hair styling spray, and the history contains multiple hair-care and styling products. In the later pause steps, attention to the history item whose SID begins with &lt;s_a_206&gt;&lt;s_b_60&gt;, <em id="A6.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Natures Bounty Optimal Solutions Hair, Skin and Nails Gummies</em>, increases. This item is related to the target through hair-care intent, so the increase supports the main-paper analysis that later pauses retrieve and aggregate target-relevant historical evidence before SID generation.</p>
</div>
<div id="A6.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Target Item
Title: Dove Hair Styling Oxygen Moisture Root Lift Spray, 3.3 Ounce
SID: &lt;|sid_begin|&gt;&lt;s_a_140&gt;&lt;s_b_39&gt;&lt;s_c_151&gt;&lt;s_d_68&gt;&lt;|sid_end|&gt;
Categories: Beauty &gt; Hair Care &gt; Styling Products &gt; Hair Sprays</p>
</div>
<div id="A6.SS2.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.SS2.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.SS2.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Full prompt text.</span></p>
</div>
